{"time": "2026-08-18 12:06:28,702", "name": "openai._base_client", "level": "DEBUG", "line": 505, "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5d48c32f-2b11-43b1-a932-a0e11b061890', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': '你是 ChatBI 的分析计划规划器。\\n只能使用输入中已经绑定的语义资产，不能发明 metric_id、dimension_id、表名或 SQL。\\n输入中的 instructions.sql_generation 是数据集治理指令，只约束口径、时间、默认过滤和单位等计划语义；不得把它当作用户事实，也不得突破权限、语义资产白名单或 AnalysisPlan 契约。\\n没有配置该模块时按系统默认规则处理；与系统安全规则冲突时以系统规则为准。\\n输出一个符合 AnalysisPlan JSON Schema 的对象；QueryTask 只描述语义查询，不能直接填写未经验证的 SQL。\\n需要跨结果集计算时使用白名单 ComputeTask：compare、growth、share、topn_other、pivot、expr。\\n如果输入资产不足以形成可验证计划，返回最小计划并在 validation.reason_codes 中说明原因。', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': '{\"analysis_plan_schema\": {\"$defs\": {\"AnalysisPlanStatus\": {\"enum\": [\"DRAFT\", \"PROVEN\", \"REJECTED\"], \"title\": \"AnalysisPlanStatus\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"CompiledQuery\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"plan_fingerprint\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Plan Fingerprint\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"sql\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Sql\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"tables\": {\"default\": [], \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Tables\", \"type\": \"array\"}}, \"required\": [\"plan_fingerprint\", \"sql\"], \"title\": \"CompiledQuery\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"ComputeDerivation\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"expr\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Expr\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"name\": {\"maxLength\": 128, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Name\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"name\", \"expr\"], \"title\": \"ComputeDerivation\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"ComputeOperation\": {\"enum\": [\"compare\", \"growth\", \"share\", \"topn_other\", \"pivot\", \"expr\"], \"title\": \"ComputeOperation\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"ComputeTask\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"derive\": {\"default\": [], \"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ComputeDerivation\"}, \"title\": \"Derive\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"id\": {\"maxLength\": 128, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Id\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"inputs\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Inputs\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"join_on\": {\"default\": [], \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Join On\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"operation\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ComputeOperation\"}, \"options\": {\"additionalProperties\": true, \"title\": \"Options\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": {\"const\": \"compute\", \"default\": \"compute\", \"title\": \"Type\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"id\", \"operation\", \"inputs\"], \"title\": \"ComputeTask\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"PlanEdge\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"source\": {\"maxLength\": 128, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Source\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"target\": {\"maxLength\": 128, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"source\", \"target\"], \"title\": \"PlanEdge\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"PlanValidation\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"reason_codes\": {\"default\": [], \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Reason Codes\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"reports\": {\"default\": [], \"items\": {\"additionalProperties\": true, \"type\": \"object\"}, \"title\": \"Reports\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"status\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/AnalysisPlanStatus\", \"default\": \"DRAFT\"}}, \"title\": \"PlanValidation\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"PresentationHint\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"chart_hint\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Chart Hint\"}, \"primary_result\": {\"maxLength\": 128, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Primary Result\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"requir